end

---点击请求领取任务按钮
---@param go UnityEngine.GameObject @按钮对象
---@param ison number @按钮都是1
function TaskGMView:OnClickRequireClaimTask(go, isOn)
    print("TaskGMView:OnClickRequireClaimTask()")
    self:ParseParams()
    _G.TaskModule:GetInstance():AcceptTask(self.Param1Number, _G.handler(self, self.OnReplyClaimTask))
end

